  "body_html": "<p>Brighten up your bedroom with this custom-designed sport bedding, perfect for basketball players and fans alike. This personalized set brings a vibrant athletic vibe to any space while keeping you cozy all year round.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize with your own chosen Name and Number for a truly unique, one-of-a-kind sports bedding piece.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Premium Material:</strong> Crafted from 100% brushed polyester fabric that is soft, durable, and lightweight, featuring a whole-piece microfiber filling with tight stitching to prevent clumping.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>FADE-RESISTANT COLOR:</strong> Our advanced manufacturing and environmental protection techniques allow the fabric to hold onto dyes, preventing fading over time.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>EASY CARE:</strong> Fully machine washable in cold water. Dries quickly and fluffs up beautifully after air drying.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>VERSATILE SIZE OPTIONS:</strong> Available in several sizes, including US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), and US King (104\" x 88\").</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Cotton/ Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Basketball D19</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Basketball Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
